    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42819" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scaenŏgrăphĭ_a</span></b> ,
		ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηνογραφία,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a drawing in
				perspective</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scaenographia est frontis et laterum
					abscedentium adumbratio ad circinique centrum omnium
					linearum responsus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					1, 2, 2</span></i>
			 Rode. (Others read <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scĭāgrăphĭ_a</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιᾶγραφία</span>, in the same
			signif.)</div>
